ds the shore at which  point they'd be ambushed by the colossal  or attack titans each time this happened  nearly all malian soldiers on board  would be locked up in a prison cause the  vast majority of them hated aldians and  didn't want to join the volunteers  over the next few months yelena and  onyankapon started to assist the island  in different ways like when they  proposed the idea of building a port  this was the first major step in turning  parodies into a modern nation and during  construction the tension between certain  prisoners and albions began to decrease  with a quick example being how chef  nicolo started to like sasha what this  proved was that malians and aliens could  get along if they got to know each other  and armin thought that this was a sign  that they could talk things out with  their enemies on the other hand aaron  thought that there wasn't enough time to  try and take this peaceful approach and  he believed that they needed to do  something to let people know they can't  be messed with  in the year 852 the port was finally  complete with the island welcoming its  first foreign visitors from the nation  of hisaru hisuru is a country in asia  that used to be friendly with aldians  around 100 years ago and after meeting  with zeke and secret they agreed to make  this trip  on her arrival ambassador kyomi revealed  the full details of zeke's plan to save  parodies which he hoped would get him  brought there as soon as possible  step one of the plan was that the jager  brothers would activate a small-scale  rumbling which would warn the rest of  the world to stay away from the island  step two of the plan is that his rule  would spend the next 50 years  modernizing parodies so that in the  future they won't have to rely on the  rumbling to survive  the third and final step was that until  this modernization is complete parodies  must always have a founding titan and a  titan of royal blood so they can still  defend themselves with the rumbling if  they have to on the face of it that plan  didn't sound too bad but the final step  is what aaron didn't like because it  meant that historia and her royal blood  would need to inherit the beast titan  after zeke's time is done only then  would they consistently maintain having  a titan of royal blood and of course in  the future historia's descendants would  also need to inherit the beast for that  same reason  although she personally seemed willing  to make this sacrifice aaron point-blank  refused to let it happen and this wasn't  the first time that he's protected her  in this way back in season 3 when he  realized how to activate the founder he  didn't tell anyone because he wanted to  avoid pretty much this exact situation  where she might be turned into a royal  blooded titan because of this aaron  rejected zeke's plan and now believe  that they had to explore other options  besides the rumbling  just before we continue it's worth  mentioning that kyomi is only here since  zeke promised her access to a valuable  natural resource from paradise called  the iceberg stone and this would make  his room incredibly rich if they were to  gain access to it another reason they  came was to see mikasa who was a  descendant of their nation's ruling  family but as cool as that sounds their  main priority is still the financial  benefits that come with having the  iceberg stone  flashing forward to the year 853 the  scouts were still desperately searching  for an alternative to zeke's plan so the  historia wouldn't need to inherit the  beast titan as a last ditch attempt to  avoid following zeke's proposal hanji  suggested that maybe the scout should  physically go to mali themselves so they  can understand the enemy and hopefully  this could be the beginning of a path to  peace i should remind you guys that at  this point in the timeline the beast  titan had less than two years to live  due to the curse of emir so if parodies  kept on wasting time then they'd lose