aration of  war comes in  for various political reasons it was a  good thing for marley to have this event  before they invaded paradise with willie  tyber using his connections to invite  diplomats and journalists from around  the world  in reality what this did was give eren  the perfect chance to hurt multiple  countries at once and he sent letters to  the scouts making it clear that he was  going to attack during the declaration  regardless of whether they helped him or  not  this was a genius move from aaron  because it created a situation where the  survey corps had no choice but to help  him because if they didn't help him then  the chances are aaron would be killed  and the rest of the world would likely  wipe out the island as revenge for what  he did  that's why in the end the scout swooped  in to save both jaeger brothers because  only these two together had the power to  stop the armies of the world who as i  mentioned would want revenge  now before we move on to everything that  happened after the declaration of war  it's worth highlighting the four main  points that came out of this battle  point number one is that aaron wiped out  all of mali's top military officials  which was done on purpose to delay the  amount of time that it would take them  to get revenge on the island for that  same reason armin also destroyed the  port because with so many of mali ships  destroyed it would take them months to  reorganize their military  point number two is that error managed  to steal the warhammer titan from lara  tiber and this was a big deal as he'd  need to use its abilities later in the  timeline  point number three is that gabby killed  sasha after sneaking aboard the airship  the scouts were using to escape and  together with falco the warrior  candidates were unexpectedly brought  back to paris island  finally point number four is that zeke  tried to fake his own death and this was  important because if marley realized  that he had betrayed them then there was  no telling what they would do in  response  on their arrival back to the island the  yeager brothers were immediately  separated with aaron being put in jail  as punishment for going rogue in mali  without permission and zeke was put  under levi's supervision in this giant  forest  considering everything that happened the  government on parodies could no longer  trust aaron and believed he might be  under his brother's control which is why  zachary began looking for new candidates  to inherit the founding titan  the volunteers who had helped the island  for the past three years were then  placed under house arrest by pixis  because if you remember they had very  close ties to zeke and at the same time  gabby and falco were locked up as  prisoners of war  as a side note the military police had  been planning for months for historia to  eat zeke as soon as he arrived on the  island however the reason this didn't  happen is because the queen had now  become pregnant her pregnancy made it  too risky for her to be titanized as  nobody knew what would happen to the  baby and as a consequence it meant that  zeke had to be kept alive until after  she gave birth this is why they put him  under levi's supervision cause if it  wasn't for his story's pregnancy zeke  would have already been eaten  briefly switching back over to the other  side of the ocean despite zeke's best  efforts to fake his death mali realized  that he had betrayed them and the  decision was made to join forces with  armies from around the world to white  parodies of the face of the earth  this new global alliance of armies would  launch their attack in six months time  as the malian army by itself was  currently too weak to do anything  despite that reiner insisted that they  couldn't wait half a year to form this  global alliance and instead he convinced  general mcgath that the warriors should  ambush the island in only one month's  time  over the next few weeks the politics on  parody started to become a lot more  complicated with the emergence of a  rebel faction known as the jaegers in  the early stages this group was led by  flock and their main aim was to bring  the two jaeger brothers into contact so  they could activate the rumbling and  secure the future of the island to  achieve this goal they did several  things starting with leaking information  to the public about how aaron had been  imprisoned when the people found out  about this it caused protests across the  country as ordinary civilians couldn't  understand why their hero was being held  hostage by the military this leak caused  support for the jaegers movement to grow  among the population and soon afterwards  flock and his team of leakers were all  sent to jail  the second major thing the yaegris did  was plant a bomb to assassinate zachary  who was the highest ranking military  officer in paradise like i said earlier  zachary was actively searching for  candidates to replace aaron as the  founding titan which is precisely the  reason why the rebels decided to get rid  of him  later that same day after zachary was  killed flock and his comrades were then  secretly released from jail by other  jaegers who worked as prison guards and  they met up with aaron who'd escaped  from prison himself using the power of  his warhammer titan together their goal  was now to find zeke and to accomplish  this they intended to kidnap someone who  knew his location  commander hanji was one of the few  people aware of where zeke was being  held and it wasn't long until she was  ambushed by the rebels and forced at  gunpoint by flock to take him to the  beast titan  speaking of the beast titan for about a  month he'd been under the watchful eye  of captain levi and 30 other soldiers  meaning it was virtually impossible for  him to try and escape or at least it  would have been if zeke didn't already  have a plan  three years ago when the first service  ships arrived he loaded these ships with  crates of wine that were contaminated  with his spinal fluid it was yelena's  mission to make sure the wine was  consumed by as many high-ranking offices  as possible and over the years this wine  actually became famous on the island  with many soldiers showing an interest  in trying it what nobody else knew was  that the wine was tainted meaning that  one screen from zeke would turn any  alien who drank it into a pure titan  unfortunately for the 30 soldiers  watching over him they'd been drinking  it ever since they arrived in the forest  as it was given to them by new survey  corps recruits who were secretly jaegers  in disguise  as a result zeke was just patiently  waiting for the day that he and aaron  agreed to meet and once that day came he  screamed at the top of his lungs  titanizing every soldier around him  except for the captain  up until now he boldly assumed that levi  wouldn't be able to kill 30 of his own  men  however when it came down to it he dealt  with them pretty quickly and soon  started chasing after zeke himself  during their fight the eldest yeager  brother was forced to transform into his  beast titan and after a brief struggle  he was blown out of his titan body by  thunderspears  as much as levi wanted to kill him in  this moment to get revenge for his  comrades and obviously evan as well he  knew he couldn't do it cause if he did  then it would all but guarantee they'd  lose the power of the beast titan for  that reason he began transporting zeke's  body back to the walls and tied the  guide to a thundersphere to make sure he  wouldn't move  regardless of that zeke still decided to  take his chances and by moving his neck  he detonated the spear blowing up  himself levi and his innocent horse in  the process  the sound of this blast was heard by  flock and hanji who were on their way to  the forest and after hearing this noise  flock decided to change directions so  they could go and investigate  meanwhile as zeke was close to death a  vision of a young girl appeared to him  and he was soon approached by one of the  pure titans he created earlier this  titan then unusually ripped open its own  stomach and put what was left of zeke's  body inside making this the last time we  saw him for the first half of the season  switching back to what was happening  inside the walls falcon and gabby were  on the run after escaping from prison  but were eventually given a place to  stay by a nice family in the countryside  in a strange twist of fate this turned  out to be sasha's family aka the person  who gabby had killed on the airship but  for now nobody realized that connection  sasha's adopted sister kaio was the only  person who knew falco and gabby were  from mali and she tried to help them get  back home by introducing them to nicolo  i briefly mentioned this earlier but  nikola was a malian chef who had a huge  crush on sasha and after her death he  invited her family to come and taste his  food when they eventually went to the  restaurant kaia made sure to bring the  two warrior candidates so they could  meet him however things took a dark turn  when nicolo realized that gabby was the  warrior candidate from the airship in  the scuffle that followed a drop of  zeke's tainted wine entered falco's  mouth meaning that if the beast titan  was to scream anywhere near him he would  be turned into a pure titan as if this  wasn't enough sasha's family were then  told that gabby was the one who killed  their daughter and mika certain armin  took her into a different room to  de-escalate the situation  this is when one of my favorite moments  in the entire season happened because  aaron who would not long escape from  prison just casually walks into the room  to have a chat with his  childhood during the following  conversation he just spent time roasting  them both for having no free will as he  claimed that mikasa only protects him  due to her ackman programming while  armin is being controlled by the  memories he inherited from bertolt  from the language he was using it was  clear from the beginning that he was  trying to upset them and later on jon  suggests that there might have been some  hidden meaning behind it  anyhow after aaron beats arm into a pulp  he then gets his soldiers to arrest  everyone in the restaurant including  sasha's family and they're all taken to  shiganshina to be imprisoned  by this point in time the yagaris now  have full control over the military as  all the high-ranking officials had to  surrender after finding out that they'd  been poisoned by zeke's spinal fluid  until this moment pixis had actually  been plotting to steal the founding  titan from aaron to stop the jagras from  rising but when the wine situation was  revealed high-ranking soldiers began to  defect to the aegiris to avoid being  titanized this left him with literally  no other option but to surrender and so  pixies gave up and agreed to all the  demands the aegis were making  now as i mentioned earlier reiner had  convinced marley to launch a quick  surprise attack on parodies and in the  lead-up to this attack peak and porco  snuck inside the walls  we know they used pete's car titan to  get there because it was implied that  her footprints were discovered leading  to aaron realizing that there was spies  on the island that's why in this scene  he wanted gabby to help him find the  undercover warriors but before he could  finish his proposal pique shows up out  of nowhere and stabs a nearby guard  it's important to realize that in this  moment her mission is not to kill eren  but rather her orders were to lure him  to a location where the founding titan  could be eaten for that reason she  attempted to earn his trust by  pretending she was defecting from mali  and she offered to show erin where her  comrades were hiding naturally he had no  real grounds to believe anything she was  saying but because he was now in control  of the situation he at least allowed  pique the chance to point out where poco  and reina might be hiding what aaron  didn't know was that porker was already  in the building disguised as a member of  the scouts bringing us to the final  spectacle from the first half of the  season with aaron on the roof the draw  titan burst out from underneath to try  and eat the founding titan and if he had  succeeded then marley would have won  right there and then  luckily for aaron only his legs got  bitten off so he was able to use that  injury as the catalyst for his  transformation  the lightning and smoke alerted nearby  malian airships to his location and on  board these ships were reiner general  mcgath and also falco's older brother i  didn't really find time to mention colt  in the video until now but like i said  he's falco's older brother and was the  warrior candidate selected by marley to  be the next beast titan well until zeke  betrayed them  anyway people if you enjoyed this recap  then i'd appreciate if you hit that sub  button as i plan to be doing episode  breakdowns for part two of the final  season and if you're feeling generous  then do be sure to smash that like  button as well  thanks for watching as always and until  the next one peace out

